# Implementation Plan: Firebase Authentication

To enable **Fluid Sync** (Cross-Device & Cloud Access), we need to secure the Marketing Dashboard and Nucleus Server using Firebase Authentication.

## Goal
Replace open/local access with Identity-Aware access.
- **Frontend**: Users log in with Google/Email to access the Dashboard.
- **Backend**: API verifies ID tokens before processing requests.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Firebase Project Setup Required**
> You will need a Firebase Project. 
> 1. Go to [console.firebase.google.com](https://console.firebase.google.com)
> 2. Create/Select a project.
> 3. Enable **Authentication** (Google Provider or Email/Password).
> 4. Copy the **Web App Config** for `firebase_config.js`.
> 5. Generate a **Service Account Key** (`service_account.json`) for the backend.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Setup & Configuration
#### [NEW] `tools/marketing-dashboard/firebase_config.js`
- Placeholder file for Firebase Web Config.
- **Action**: User populates this.

#### [NEW] `secret/service_account.json` (GitIgnored)
- Path for the backend credential.

### 2. Frontend (Marketing Dashboard)
#### [MODIFY] [tools/marketing-dashboard/index.html](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/index.html)
- Import Firebase SDK (v9/v10 compat or CDN).
- Add `Login` / `Logout` buttons.
- Wrap `fetch('/api/ingest')` to include `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header.
- Hide "Agent Portal" until logged in.

### 3. Backend (Nucleus Server)
#### [MODIFY] [tools/marketing-dashboard/server.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/server.py)
- Import `firebase_admin` and `firebase_admin.auth`.
- Initialize App with `service_account.json` (or Application Default Credentials).
- Add Middleware to [do_POST](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/server.py#57-131) to verify `Authorization` header.
- Return `401 Unauthorized` if invalid.

### 4. Dependencies
- Install `firebase-admin` in `.venv`.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1.  **Start Server**: `python3 tools/marketing-dashboard/server.py`
2.  **Open Dashboard**: Verify Login Button appears.
3.  **Login**: Sign in (needs Firebase Config).
4.  **Action**: Submit a mock insight.
5.  **Verify**: Server logs "✅ Ingested..." only if token is valid.
